device-touchpad.png, device-pre3.png: small pictures of an HP TouchPad and an HP Pre3, for the
bezel's device button. Supplied by codepoet (webOS Archive), 2026-11-16. Their origin and licence
are to be confirmed by codepoet; until then treat them as the project's other device artwork is
treated (abandonware, shipped with notice).

icon.png: Luna DE's icon, Lunacy's moon with rounded corners, made by
DesktopLuna/build-resources/make-icon.py from Meta/LunaRound.png (see Meta/NOTICE: codepoet had
it made with ChatGPT for Lunacy, 2026-11-07). build-resources/icon.png and icon-mac.png are the
same, for the packages.

device-screen.svg: a desktop display, for "this screen" on the bezel's device button. Drawn for
Luna DE (2026-11-17); the project's own, under its licence.
